So `dest` (which is `ctry_utf`) gets one element (the replacement character 0xfffd). Then `ctryl = -1` which becomes SIZE_MAX as `size_t`.

In `badchar_utf`:
```cpp
for (size_t j = 0; j < ctryl; ++j) {
