            continue;
        ...
    }
}
```

With `ctryl = SIZE_MAX`, `j` goes from 0 to SIZE_MAX-1. `ctry_utf` has 1 element. So `ctry_utf[0]` is valid, but `ctry_utf[1]` and beyond are out of bounds. This should cause a crash (heap buffer over-read).

